WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Dan: First node is out. Traffic's moving over.

2
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.743
Priya: Any errors on the move?

3
00:00:06.743 --> 00:00:11.663
Dan: A few, but small. Second one coming out now.

4
00:00:11.663 --> 00:00:16.175
Sam: Error rate is coming down. Three point one.

5
00:00:16.175 --> 00:00:20.110
Priya: Good. I'm on it if you need a hand.

6
00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.854
Dan: Thanks. Both nodes are out.

7
00:00:23.854 --> 00:00:27.574
Sam: Two point two. Still coming down.

8
00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:32.374
Priya: Nice. Drop the link in chat so we all see it.

9
00:00:32.374 --> 00:00:36.981
Dan: Done. Just to confirm — they stay out till morning?

10
00:00:36.981 --> 00:00:41.949
Priya: Yes, keep them out. We'll fix it in the morning.

11
00:00:41.949 --> 00:00:45.117
Priya: Who's picking this up in the morning, though?

12
00:00:45.117 --> 00:00:48.572
Dan: Me. I'm on the early shift.

13
00:00:48.572 --> 00:00:53.420
Priya: Perfect. Dan, you are coming to the handover right?

